  "readmeFile": "README.MD",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 - Major Update:\n- Multi-target support (.NET 6, 7, 8, 9)\n- WebApplicationBuilder extension for minimal APIs\n- IServiceCollection extension methods\n- Elasticsearch health check integration\n- Correlation ID enricher for request tracking\n- Structured logging helper methods\n- Elasticsearch v8 support\n- API Key authentication support\n- Cluster support (multiple nodes)\n- Enhanced error handling and diagnostics",
